    "No source code, tool manifest, or detailed runtime configuration for procurement-orchestrator or payments-agent was provided, so internal data-flow enforcement and peer-side validations could not be verified.",
    "The exact review volume, retention, and audit characteristics of manager approval and payment records were not described, which limits confidence on repudiation and approval-fatigue related judgments."
  ]
